        "user_id": "reviewer_office_0704",
        "rating": 5,
        "body": "During the lunch break, people do ten-minute neck and shoulder exercises. The space is free, but there are not many foam rollers. More people arrive after 12:30 on weekdays, but there is no need to purchase a class.",
